// ============================================================
// LifeBook 数据模型 —— 单一事实来源
// 与前端 types/index.ts 一一对应；前端 API 层契约由本模型映射而来。
// ============================================================

generator client {
  provider      = "prisma-client-js"
  binaryTargets = ["native", "debian-openssl-3.0.x"]
}
datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

// ---------- 枚举（SQLite 不支持 Prisma enum，已改为字符串常量，见 src/common/enums.ts） ----------

// ---------- 用户与作者 ----------

model User {
  id           String    @id @default(cuid())
  username     String    @unique
  nickname     String
  avatar       String?
  coverImage   String?
  bio          String?
  region       String?
  country      String?
  gender       String    @default("SECRET")
  role         String    @default("AUTHOR")

  // 认证
  passwordHash String?
  oauthProvider String? // wechat / apple
  oauthId      String?
  email        String?   @unique

  // 兴趣与人生标签（SQLite 存 JSON 字符串，读取时由序列化层解析）
  interests    String  @default("[]")
  tags         String  @default("[]")
  // 用户设置（主题/语言/通知偏好/阅读偏好，JSON 字符串）
  settings     String  @default("{}")

  // 创作天数（自注册起）
  createdDays  Int       @default(0)

  // 关系
  works        Work[]
  comments     Comment[]
  likes        Like[]
  collections  Collection[]
  resonates    Resonate[]
  notifications Notification[] @relation("notify_to")
  sentNotifications Notification[] @relation("notify_actor")
  shelfItems   ShelfItem[]
  drafts       Draft[]
  aiConversations AiConversation[]
  following    Follow[]   @relation("following")
  followers    Follow[]   @relation("followers")
  conversationsA Conversation[] @relation("conv_user_a")
  conversationsB Conversation[] @relation("conv_user_b")
  messages     Message[]
  commentLikes CommentLike[]
  bookmarks    Bookmark[]
  highlights   Highlight[]

  createdAt    DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime  @updatedAt

  @@index([nickname])
  @@unique([oauthProvider, oauthId])
}

// 关注关系（自关联）
model Follow {
  followerId  String
  followingId String
  follower    User   @relation("following", fields: [followerId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  following   User   @relation("followers", fields: [followingId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  createdAt   DateTime @default(now())

  @@id([followerId, followingId])
}

// ---------- 作品 ----------

model Work {
  id          String    @id @default(cuid())
  authorId    String
  author      User      @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  title       String
  subtitle    String?
  summary     String
  coverImage  String?
  coverColor  String?

  categoryL1  String
  categoryL2  String
  categoryL3  String?
  emotion     String?
  city        String?
  country     String?

  // 内容模型（编辑排版核心）
  format      String    @default("MEMOIR") // 内容形式：MEMOIR/DIARY/LETTER/PHOTO_STORY/...
  excerpt     String?   // 故事摘录（作者原文的一句话）
  lifeStage   String?   // 人生阶段：童年/青春/大学/初入社会/成年/成家/中年/晚年
  occupation  String?   // 职业
  storySource String    @default("AUTHOR_WRITTEN") // 真实来源：作者撰写/口述整理/AI辅助/作者照片
  year        String?   // 故事发生年份

  // 首页内容形态（生活流混合排版）
  feedKind     String    @default("ESSAY") // PHOTO/ESSAY/NOVEL
  momentLabel  String?   // 人生印记标签，如「2019 · 第一次离家」
  featuredLine String?   // 一句金句（卡片引用）

  totalWords  Int       @default(0)
  chapterCount Int      @default(0)
  status      String    @default("ONGOING")
  visibility  String    @default("PUBLIC")
  coverRatio  String    @default("RATIO_16_9")

  // 计数（高频读，可后续用 Redis 缓存 / 物化视图）
  viewCount    Int       @default(0)
  likeCount    Int       @default(0)
  collectCount Int       @default(0)
  commentCount Int       @default(0)
  resonateCount Int      @default(0)
  readMinutes  Int       @default(5)

  publishAt   DateTime?
  createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
  updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

  chapters    Chapter[]
  comments    Comment[]
  tags        Tag[]
  likes       Like[]
  collections Collection[]
  resonates   Resonate[]
  notifications Notification[]
  messages    Message[]
  shelfItems  ShelfItem[]
  bookmarks   Bookmark[]
  highlights  Highlight[]
  insight     WorkAi?

  @@index([authorId])
  @@index([categoryL1, categoryL2])
  @@index([status, visibility])
  @@index([publishAt])
}

// 章节（content 为结构化富内容 JSON，与前端 ContentBlock 联合类型对应）
model Chapter {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  workId    String
  work      Work     @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  order     Int
  title     String
  content   String // ContentBlock[]（JSON 字符串）
  wordCount Int      @default(0)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  comments  Comment[]

  @@unique([workId, order])
}

// ---------- 标签 ----------

model Tag {
  id    String @id @default(cuid())
  name  String @unique
  works Work[]

  @@index([name])
}

// ---------- 互动（赞 / 收藏 / 共鸣） ----------

model Like {
  userId String
  workId String
  user   User   @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  work   Work   @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@id([userId, workId])
}

model Collection {
  userId String
  workId String
  user   User   @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  work   Work   @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@id([userId, workId])
}

// 共鸣 —— 「我也有过相似经历」
model Resonate {
  userId String
  workId String
  user   User   @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  work   Work   @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@id([userId, workId])
}

// ---------- 评论 ----------

model Comment {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  workId    String
  work      Work     @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  chapterId String?
  chapter   Chapter? @relation(fields: [chapterId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  authorId  String
  author    User     @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  content   String
  parentId  String?
  parent    Comment? @relation("replies", fields: [parentId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  replies   Comment[] @relation("replies")
  likes     Int      @default(0)
  likedBy   CommentLike[]
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([workId])
  @@index([authorId])
}

// 评论点赞（用户维度去重）
model CommentLike {
  commentId String
  comment   Comment  @relation(fields: [commentId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  @@id([commentId, userId])
  @@index([userId])
}

// 书签（阅读状态：用户在某部作品中收藏的具体章节）
model Bookmark {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId       String
  user         User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  workId       String
  work         Work     @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  chapterOrder Int
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([userId, workId, chapterOrder])
  @@index([userId])
}

// 划线（阅读状态：用户对章节内具体文字的选择标记，持久化到数据库）
model Highlight {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId       String
  user         User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  workId       String
  work         Work     @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  chapterOrder Int
  text         String
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([userId, workId, chapterOrder, text])
  @@index([userId])
}

// ---------- 通知 ----------

model Notification {
  id        String     @id @default(cuid())
  userId    String
  user      User       @relation("notify_to", fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type      String
  actorId   String?
  actor     User?      @relation("notify_actor", fields: [actorId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  content   String?
  workId    String?
  work      Work?      @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  read      Boolean    @default(false)
  createdAt DateTime   @default(now())

  @@index([userId, read])
}

// ---------- 私信 ----------

model Conversation {
  id          String   @id @default(cuid())
  userAId     String
  userBId     String
  userA       User     @relation("conv_user_a", fields: [userAId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  userB       User     @relation("conv_user_b", fields: [userBId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  lastMessage String?
  lastAt      DateTime @default(now())
  messages    Message[]

  @@unique([userAId, userBId])
}

model Message {
  id             String      @id @default(cuid())
  conversationId String
  conversation   Conversation @relation(fields: [conversationId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  fromId         String
  from           User        @relation(fields: [fromId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  type           String    @default("TEXT")
  content        String
  read           Boolean     @default(false)
  workId         String?
  work           Work?       @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: SetNull)
  createdAt      DateTime    @default(now())

  @@index([conversationId, createdAt])
}

// ---------- 书架 / 阅读进度 ----------

model ShelfItem {
  id               String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId           String
  user             User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  workId           String
  work             Work     @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  progress         Float    @default(0) // 0-1
  lastChapterOrder Int      @default(0)
  lastReadAt       DateTime @default(now())

  @@unique([userId, workId])
}

// ---------- 草稿 ----------

model Draft {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId    String
  user      User     @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  title     String
  content   String?
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([userId])
}

// ---------- AI 采访对话（记忆） ----------

model AiConversation {
  id           String      @id @default(cuid())
  userId       String
  user         User        @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  topic        String?
  currentStep  Int         @default(0)
  storyContext String      @default("{}") // Life Context JSON：人物/地点/时间/事件/关系/情绪/物件
  status       String      @default("ACTIVE") // ACTIVE / COMPLETED
  createdAt    DateTime    @default(now())
  updatedAt    DateTime    @updatedAt
  messages     AiMessage[]

  @@index([userId])
}

model AiMessage {
  id             String         @id @default(cuid())
  conversationId String
  conversation   AiConversation @relation(fields: [conversationId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  role           String // "ai" | "user"
  content        String
  createdAt      DateTime       @default(now())

  @@index([conversationId, createdAt])
}

// ---------- AI 特色（时间轴 / 情绪曲线 / 人物关系图） ----------

model WorkAi {
  id        String  @id @default(cuid())
  workId    String  @unique
  work      Work    @relation(fields: [workId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  timeline  String // TimelineNode[]（JSON 字符串）
  emotionCurve String // EmotionPoint[]（JSON 字符串）
  characterGraph String // { nodes, edges }（JSON 字符串）
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
}

// ---------- AI 用量统计（成本安全 / 每日限制） ----------

model AiUsage {
  id            String   @id @default(cuid())
  userId        String?
  provider      String
  model         String
  feature       String   // INTERVIEW / MEMORY_EXTRACTION / CHAPTER_GENERATION / POLISH
  inputTokens   Int      @default(0)
  outputTokens  Int      @default(0)
  estimatedCost Float    @default(0)
  createdAt     DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([createdAt])
  @@index([userId, createdAt])
}
